%% TEM Single Iteration Data Flow
sequenceDiagram
    participant Walk as Walk Input
    participant TEMModel as TEMModel
    participant Trans as TransitionModel
    participant Inf as Inference Path
    participant Gen as Generative Path
    participant Mem as Memory System
    participant Loss as Loss Computation
    
    Walk->>TEMModel: forward walk prev_iter prev_M
    
    loop For each location x a
        TEMModel->>TEMModel: iteration x locations a_prev M_prev x_prev g_prev
        
        Note over TEMModel,Trans: Transition Phase
        TEMModel->>Trans: gen_g a_prev g_prev locations
        Trans-->>TEMModel: g_gen plus uncertainty σ
        
        Note over TEMModel,Mem: Inference Phase
        TEMModel->>Inf: inference x locations M_prev x_prev g_gen
        Inf->>Inf: encode x to x_c
        Inf->>Inf: filter x_c x_prev to x
        Inf->>Inf: tile x to x_
        Inf->>Mem: retrieve p_x from M_inf using x_
        Mem-->>Inf: p_x
        Inf->>Inf: inf_g fuse g_gen p_x shiny
        Note over Inf: precision-weighted fusion
        Inf->>Inf: inf_p g_inf tensor x to p_inf
        Inf-->>TEMModel: x g_inf p_x p_inf
        
        Note over TEMModel,Mem: Generative Phase
        TEMModel->>Gen: generative M_prev p_inf g_inf g_gen
        Gen->>Gen: Route 1 p_inf to x_p
        Gen->>Mem: Route 2 g_inf to p_g_inf
        Mem-->>Gen: p_g_inf
        Gen->>Gen: p_g_inf to x_g
        Gen->>Mem: Route 3 g_gen to p_g_gen
        Mem-->>Gen: p_g_gen
        Gen->>Gen: p_g_gen to x_gt
        Gen-->>TEMModel: x_gen x_logits p_gen
        
        Note over TEMModel,Mem: Memory Update
        TEMModel->>Mem: hebbian M_prev p_inf p_gen η λ
        Mem->>Mem: M_gen update
        Mem->>Mem: M_inf update
        Mem-->>TEMModel: M updated
        
        Note over TEMModel,Loss: Loss Computation
        TEMModel->>Loss: compute all parameters
        Loss->>Loss: L_p_g place match
        Loss->>Loss: L_p_x sensory match
        Loss->>Loss: L_x_gen generation quality
        Loss->>Loss: L_x_g inference quality
        Loss->>Loss: L_x_p direct quality
        Loss->>Loss: L_g abstract match
        Loss->>Loss: L_reg_g regularization
        Loss->>Loss: L_reg_p regularization
        Loss-->>TEMModel: L 8 components
        
        TEMModel->>TEMModel: store Iteration
    end
    
    TEMModel-->>Walk: steps list of Iterations
